  "summary": "Manage my spring exchange preparations from course selection to arrival readiness. I need a valid full-time study plan, housing paperwork, a realistic budget and a calendar I can rely on. Keep the required methods course, stay within $4,000 in preparation costs, and share only the documents each recipient actually needs. Plan the work yourself and carry open decisions across our sessions.",
